{"title":"Lightslate","slug":"Lightslate","pageid":240,"revid":15569,"timestamp":"2024-10-29T00:57:28Z","lastEditor":"FrostyLogic1017","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.0.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"01/14/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"ore","text":"Ore"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Lightslate</b> is one of the many rock nodes that spawn around Oakland. These nodes are found all over the spawn area, in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>, and the small-forested section across the bridge. Gigantic versions of Lightslate can be found on Pi Island.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"ore\">Ore</h2>\n<p>The chart below displays all possible ore that spawn within this node.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Ink Ore Node\">Ink Ore Node</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Inkstone/\">Inkstone</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Copper1\">Copper1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Copper/\">Copper</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Tin\">Tin</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tin/\">Tin</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite1\">Pyrite1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pyrite/\">Pyrite</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Iron1\">Iron1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Iron/\">Iron</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Mythril 1\">Mythril 1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mythril/\">Mythril</a></td>\n<td>1/100 Chance Spawn\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Adurite\">Adurite</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Adurite/\">Adurite</a>\n</td>\n<td>1/175 Chance Spawn\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: RawMagnetite\">RawMagnetite</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Magnetite/\">Magnetite</a></td>\n<td>1/1000 Chance Spawn (Nighttime only)\n<p>Magnetite spawns <b>exclusively</b> in Lightslate nodes.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"2887e69ba44b044dc4bac098dca7bfdc\" data-seq-no=\"1\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Lightslate_Map-png\"><span data-unresolved=\"1\"><noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location on the Map\">Location on the Map</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: Location on the Map\">Location on the Map</span></span></div></div><div>Location on the Map</div></div></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>These nodes can spawn in a medium range of sizes.</li>\n<li>Lightslate could formerly spawn Lumite, before the developers changed Lumite to spawn in Prismarine only shortly after introduction. As such Lumite Lightslate ores may be incredibly rare</li>\n<li>Marble may appear as a mineral in Lightslate</li>\n<li>It's raw variant uses a pre-2022 Slate Roblox material.</li>\n<li>Its refined variant uses a pre-2022 Concrete Roblox material.</li>\n<li>Its forged variant uses a pre-2022 Cobblestone material</li></ul>"}
